title: Yin and Yang
text: A QUAD BENDER is a bender with mirrors on both faces, so it turns a beam from either side. Meet red and blue in the middle and send them off to opposite corners.
trick: quad bender basics: one piece bends two opposite beams, one on each face
motif: point symmetry
expect: merges>=1
